{
  "name": "03 · Leads de Google Ads → app",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · Leads de Google Ads\nEn Google Ads → formulario de clientes potenciales → **Integración de webhook**:\n- URL: `https://TU-N8N/webhook/google-ads-leads`\n- Clave: el valor de `GOOGLE_ADS_WEBHOOK_KEY`\n\nPon el **form_id** en la ficha del cliente de la app. Usa «Enviar datos de prueba» para comprobarlo.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9f80fba1-5a78-477a-aafd-0b0210b4b7c9",
      "name": "Nota ed62",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "google-ads-leads",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0a8b0291-4325-4647-b615-12189c460986",
      "name": "Webhook Google Ads",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "5239ff18-625d-4c41-b8c0-22537a8d68ee"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Formato de Google: { lead_id, form_id, campaign_id, google_key, is_test, user_column_data: [{column_id, column_name, string_value}] }\nconst b = $input.first().json.body ?? $input.first().json;\nif (!$('Config').first().json.GOOGLE_ADS_WEBHOOK_KEY || b.google_key !== $('Config').first().json.GOOGLE_ADS_WEBHOOK_KEY) {\n  return [{ json: { valido: false, motivo: 'google_key incorrecta' } }];\n}\nconst nombres = { FULL_NAME: 'full_name', FIRST_NAME: 'first_name', LAST_NAME: 'last_name', PHONE_NUMBER: 'phone', EMAIL: 'email', POSTAL_CODE: 'codigo_postal', CITY: 'ciudad', REGION: 'provincia' };\nconst answers = {};\nfor (const c of b.user_column_data || []) {\n  const k = nombres[c.column_id] || c.column_name || c.column_id;\n  answers[k] = c.string_value;\n}\nreturn [{ json: {\n  valido: true,\n  lead: {\n    source: 'google',\n    form_id: String(b.form_id ?? ''),\n    external_id: String(b.lead_id ?? ''),\n    campaign: b.campaign_id ? 'Google Ads ' + b.campaign_id : null,\n    consent_text: 'Formulario de cliente potencial de Google Ads' + (b.is_test ? ' (PRUEBA)' : ''),\n    answers,\n  },\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "2a564b60-8752-4d56-94d7-c353176a9602",
      "name": "Validar y preparar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
